          {"state": "Dying #3", "expression": "round(-$hp*3)", "explanation": "Roll vs. HT to avoid death\nRoll vs. HT-3 every second to avoid unconsciousness\nMove and Dodge halved (B419)", "ops": ["halve_move", "halve_dodge"]},
